-- The Armv8-M corpus lane's machine: QEMU's mps2-an505, whose Cortex-M33
-- executes the corpus built at armv8-m.main (D607).  This describes an
-- emulator's map for the lane's harness, not a chip, and nothing else
-- imports it.  The harness takes only the core, the table's length and
-- the memory beside this file; no interrupt is named, since no corpus
-- program takes one.

compiler.device("mps2-an505")
compiler.core("cortex-m33")
compiler.vectors(48)
